<title>DENMARK: EIB issues four pct, six year 500 mln Dkk bond.</title>
<headline>EIB issues four pct, six year 500 mln Dkk bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Investment Bank (EIB) on Monday issued a four percent, six year 500 million crown bond, lead managers Jyske Bank and Gudme Raaschou Bankaktieselskab said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The issue will be sought listing on Copenhagen Bourse from December 20 this year, it said.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
